          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "2025=1928\\cdot1+97,\\quad1928=97\\cdot19+85,\\quad97=85\\cdot1+12,\\quad85=12\\cdot7+1",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{2025}{1928}=1+\\cfrac1{19+\\cfrac1{1+\\cfrac1{7+\\cfrac1{12}}}}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2)　因数定理を根で使う",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(g(x)\\) が \\(f(x)\\) で割り切れる条件を、\\(g(a/2)=g(b/2)=0\\) として整数条件へ直します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "showa-medical-2025-general-i-mathematics-answers-p006",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "g\\left(\\frac a2\\right)=g\\left(\\frac b2\\right)=0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "それぞれの積が0になる場合を整理し、\\(a<b\\) と整数条件を課します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "(a,b)=(-4,4),\\ (-2,2),\\ (-2,4)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3-1)　絶対値と底が1未満であることを分ける",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "まず \\(x>0,y>0\\) を確認し、\\(x,y\\) が1以下か1より大きいかで4つの場合に分けます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "showa-medical-2025-general-i-mathematics-answers-p007",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "y\\ge\\frac1{2x},\\quad y\\le2x,\\quad y\\ge\\frac x2,\\quad y\\le\\frac2x",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3-2)　左右の区間に分けて面積を積分する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "S=\\int_{1/2}^{1}\\left(2x-\\frac1{2x}\\right)dx+\\int_1^2\\left(\\frac2x-\\frac x2\\right)dx=\\frac32\\log2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(4)　単調減少関数を長方形で挟む",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(y=1/\\sqrt x\\) の単調減少性を使い、各区間の面積と数列の項を上下から比較します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "showa-medical-2025-general-i-mathematics-answers-p008",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q2-integral-graph",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac1{\\sqrt{k+1}}<\\int_k^{k+1}\\frac{dx}{\\sqrt x}<\\frac1{\\sqrt k}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "88<S_{2025}<89",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "したがって整数部分は88です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "showa-medical-2025-general-i-mathematics-answers-p009",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(4)　上下評価を確認する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "S_{2025}<1+\\int_1^{2025}\\frac{dx}{\\sqrt x}=89",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "S_{2025}>\\int_1^{2026}\\frac{dx}{\\sqrt x}>88",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "注意",
            "text": "問題文の近似を使う場合も、上側と下側の不等式を別々に作ることが重要です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "showa-medical-2025-general-i-mathematics-answers-p010",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第3問　座標空間の四面体と回転体（学習者向け解説）",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "解答",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "(1)\\ -1<t<-\\frac12,\\ \\frac12<t<1",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "(2)\\ \\frac{\\sqrt3+2}{2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "(3)\\ V_x=\\frac{\\sqrt2\\pi}{4},\\quad V_y=\\frac{\\sqrt2\\pi}{12},\\quad V_z=\\frac{\\sqrt2\\pi}{2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(1)　残りの座標が存在する条件まで確認する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q3-tetrahedron",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "p^2+q^2=1,\\quad t^2+u^2=1,\\quad qt=\\frac12",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "showa-medical-2025-general-i-mathematics-answers-p011",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "u^2>0,\\ p^2>0\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad-1<t<-\\frac12,\\ \\frac12<t<1",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2)　合同な面をまとめて表面積を1変数にする",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "S(t)=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}+2\\sqrt{t^2(1-t^2)}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "S(t)=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}+2\\sqrt{-\\left(t^2-\\frac12\\right)^2+\\frac14}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(t^2=1/2\\) のとき最大値 \\((\\sqrt3+2)/2\\) です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "showa-medical-2025-general-i-mathematics-answers-p012",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3)　x軸周りは回転後の断面積を積分する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q3-x-cross-section",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "S_x(k)=(1-\\sqrt2k)\\pi",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "V_x=\\int_0^{1/\\sqrt2}S_x(k)dk=\\frac{\\sqrt2\\pi}{4}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "y軸周りは半径・高さともに \\(1/\\sqrt2\\) の円錐として計算します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "V_y=\\frac13\\pi\\left(\\frac1{\\sqrt2}\\right)^2\\frac1{\\sqrt2}=\\frac{\\sqrt2\\pi}{12}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "showa-medical-2025-general-i-mathematics-answers-p013",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "z軸周りは対称性で2倍する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q3-z-cross-section",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "V_z=2V_x=\\frac{\\sqrt2\\pi}{2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第4問　反復試行の確率と最頻値（学習者向け解説）",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "解答",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "P_1=\\frac1{729},\\quad P_2=\\frac4{729},\\quad P_3=\\frac{28}{2187}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "P_n=\\frac{(n+4)(n+3)(n+2)(n+1)n}{120}\\left(\\frac13\\right)^6\\left(\\frac23\\right)^{n-1}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "n=10,11",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "showa-medical-2025-general-i-mathematics-answers-p014",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(1)　最後の回転を固定する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "y軸へ達するには15度回転が6回必要です。最後の試行は必ず回転なので、その直前までの回転5回と移動回数を数えます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "P_1=\\left(\\frac13\\right)^6,\\quad P_2={}_6C_1\\left(\\frac23\\right)\\left(\\frac13\\right)^6",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2)　一般の移動回数へ広げる",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "P_n={}_{n+4}C_5\\left(\\frac13\\right)^6\\left(\\frac23\\right)^{n-1}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3)　隣接項比を1と比較する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "showa-medical-2025-general-i-mathematics-answers-p015",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{P_{n+1}}{P_n}=\\frac{2(n+5)}{3n}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "比は \\(n<10\\) で1より大きく、\\(n=10\\) で1、\\(n>10\\) で1より小さくなります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "P_1<\\cdots<P_{10}=P_{11}>P_{12}>\\cdots",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "講評からの学び",
            "text": "原本講評は全体の計算量が多く、取捨選択が必要としています。第4問と第2問の短問を先に確保し、第1問(3)・第3問(3)は後回しにする方針が有効です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
